  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mental health for deaf youth in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the World Health Organization, 1 in 4 people will have a mental disorder in their lifetime.  It is estimated that the pandemic has increased the prevalence of depression and anxiety by 25/27% worldwide (UN 2022).    The change we seek is to eliminate the barriers of accessibility to psychological services the deaf population faces in Colombia.  In particular, your donation will support deaf youth get direct attention from psychologists competent in the Colombian Sign Language.</narrative>
  </description>
